OL,3,GNEWSARAF veteran with leg injury
OL,4,Aawarded special poppy
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn RAF veteran whose legs were crushed
OL,7,Fin an accident said he was grateful to
OL,8,Fbe awarded a special poppy at the
OL,9,Flaunch of the annual Royal British
OL,10,FLegion (RBL) poppy appeal.
OL,12,FNeil Fellingham, 38, was honoured at
OL,13,Fthe Battle Back Centre in Lilleshall,
OL,14,FShropshire, on Thursday with a
OL,15,Fcommemorative poppy made from the metal
OL,16,Fof World War Two Spitfires.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
