OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSARAF veteran with leg injury
OL,4,Aawarded special poppy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ex-serviceman, who served in the
OL,7,FRAF for more than 12 years as a senior
OL,8,Faircraftsman technician, said it was a
OL,9,F"huge opportunity" to say thank you to
OL,10,Fthe armed forces community and "other
OL,11,Fpeople like me".
OL,13,F"Very grateful to receive a wonderful,
OL,14,Fvery bespoke custom poppy," he said.
